# What this app keeps beside the project.
#
# The run configurations belong to everybody working on it, so they are
# committed, and so is the backlog: what is left to do is the project's,
# not one machine's. Everything else — which files were open, where the
# caret was — is state and is not.
*
!.gitignore
!run/
!run/**
!backlog/
!backlog/**
